SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
END

USE solution 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite   0.0 10.0
    Gypsum    0.0 10.0
    CO2(g)    0.0 1.0
    CH4(g)    0.69897 5.0
    H2S(g)    1.0 10.0
    Aragonite 0.0 0.0
END
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file output.sel
    -si Aragonite Calcite Gypsum
    -temp
END
